# build junk
.vs/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# local-only: raw masters & release upload staging (never deploy / never commit)
/_source/
/_release_media/

# heavy media lives on GitHub Releases, not in the repo
*.mp4
# ...except the tiny intro clips: WebGL cannot texture a cross-origin video
# (Release assets send no CORS header), so these must ship with the site.
!TanTamTrang/TanTamTrang/wwwroot/media/intro/*.mp4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.cr2
*.CR2
*.zip
